  "name": "luh-2022-usenix-dev-sampling",
  "notes": "This is the replication package for the USENIX'22 paper “Where to Recruit for Security Development Studies: Comparing Six Software Developer Samples”.\r\n\r\nTo support the reproducibility of our work, we provide the following materials in this replication package:\r\n(a) the screening and final survey questions we used, (b) the formatted collection of questions we found in our literature evaluation, (c) text used in the recruitment emails, (d) text used in the the job posts, (e) additional figures, (f) additional tables, and (g) the consent forms.",
